{
  "name": "Stone Appreciator",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You've always admired the craft of stone. As a Bonus Action, you gain Tremorsense with a range of 60 feet for 10 minutes; you must be on a stone surface or touching one to use it. You can use this Bonus Action a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><p>In addition, you know the approximate value of any gem, piece of jewelry, or stonework you handle.</p>",
